  "notes": "{転勤|てんきん} means being transferred to a different office or branch within the same company. This is common in large Japanese corporations.\n\nRelated terms:\n- {転職|てんしょく} (changing jobs - different company)\n- {異動|いどう} (personnel change, reassignment)\n- {単身赴任|たんしんふにん} (living away from family for work)\n- {転校|てんこう} (school transfer - for children)\n\nCommon expressions:\n- {転勤|てんきん}{族|ぞく} (people who frequently transfer for work)\n- {転勤|てんきん}{先|さき} (new workplace after transfer)\n- {転勤|てんきん}{命令|めいれい} (transfer order)",
